.*
.* QUIUPRFTYP: DSPUSRPRF's other TYPE displays: the objects a user is
.* authorized to (*OBJAUT), owns (*OBJOWN) or is the primary group of
.* (*OBJPGP), the commands (*CMDAUT) and devices (*DEVAUT) it has a
.* private authority to, and a group's members (*GRPMBR). OBJHEAD and
.* DTAHEAD are the authority groups' headings, dashed to their width;
.* the authority cells hold ` X` where the user has the authority.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TYPECL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=WIDECL BASETYPE='CHAR 13'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=BITCL BASETYPE='CHAR 3'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=BIT5CL BASETYPE='CHAR 5'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=HEADCL BASETYPE='CHAR 40'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=UPNAME CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=TOTAL CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJHEAD CLASS=HEADCL.
:VAR NAME=DTAHEAD CLASS=HEADCL.
:VAR NAME=OBJ CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJTYPE CLASS=TYPECL.
:VAR NAME=ASPDEV CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OPR CLASS=BITCL.
:VAR NAME=MGT CLASS=BITCL.
:VAR NAME=EXIST CLASS=BIT5CL.
:VAR NAME=ALTER CLASS=BIT5CL.
:VAR NAME=REF CLASS=BITCL.
:VAR NAME=READ CLASS=BIT5CL.
:VAR NAME=ADD CLASS=BIT5CL.
:VAR NAME=UPD CLASS=BIT5CL.
:VAR NAME=DLT CLASS=BIT5CL.
:VAR NAME=EXE CLASS=BIT5CL.
:VAR NAME=OOBJ CLASS=WIDECL.
:VAR NAME=OOBJLIB CLASS=WIDECL.
:VAR NAME=OOBJTYPE CLASS=WIDECL.
:VAR NAME=OASPDEV CLASS=WIDECL.
:VAR NAME=OHOLDER CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=CMDNAME CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=CMDLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=CMDAUT CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DEVNAME CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DEVAUT CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=MBRNAME CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=MBRTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=AUTVIEW CLASS=BITCL VALUE='OBJ'.
:COND NAME=OBJVIEW EXPR='&AUTVIEW. EQ "OBJ"'.
:COND NAME=DTAVIEW EXPR='&AUTVIEW. EQ "DTA"'.
:LISTDEF NAME=AUTS VARS='OBJ OBJLIB OBJTYPE ASPDEV OPR MGT EXIST ALTER REF READ ADD UPD DLT EXE'.
:LISTDEF NAME=OWNS VARS='OOBJ OOBJLIB OOBJTYPE OASPDEV OHOLDER'.
:LISTDEF NAME=CMDS VARS='CMDNAME CMDLIB CMDAUT'.
:LISTDEF NAME=DEVS VARS='DEVNAME DEVAUT'.
:LISTDEF NAME=MBRS VARS='MBRNAME MBRTEXT'.
:KEYL NAME=KEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION=TOP.F17=Top
:KEYI KEY=F18 ACTION=BOTTOM.F18=Bottom
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=AUTKEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=OBJVIEW.F11=Display data authorities
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=DTAVIEW.F11=Display object authorities
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION=TOP.F17=Top
:KEYI KEY=F18 ACTION=BOTTOM.F18=Bottom
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=OBJAUT KEYL=AUTKEYS HELP=OBJAUTH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SPACE.Display Authorized Objects
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATACOL WIDTH=24.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=UPNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/UPNAME'.User profile
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=AUTS VIEWS=2 SCROLL=YES.(The user is not authorized to any objects.)
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJ USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OBJ'.Object
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJLIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OBJLIB'.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OBJTYPE'.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=ASPDEV USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/ASPDEV'.ASP  Device
:LISTGRP COL=OBJAUTS.&OBJHEAD.
:LISTCOL VAR=OPR USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OPR'.Opr
:LISTCOL VAR=MGT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/MGT'.Mgt
:LISTCOL VAR=EXIST USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EXIST'.Exist
:LISTCOL VAR=ALTER USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/ALTER'.Alter
:LISTCOL VAR=REF USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/REF'.Ref
:ELISTGRP.
:LISTGRP COL=DTAAUTS.&DTAHEAD.
:LISTCOL VAR=READ USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/READ'.Read
:LISTCOL VAR=ADD USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/ADD'.Add
:LISTCOL VAR=UPD USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/UPD'.Update
:LISTCOL VAR=DLT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DLT'.Delete
:LISTCOL VAR=EXE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EXE'.Execute
:ELISTGRP.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OBJ OBJLIB OBJTYPE ASPDEV OBJAUTS'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OBJ OBJLIB OBJTYPE ASPDEV DTAAUTS'.
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=OBJPGP KEYL=AUTKEYS HELP=OBJPGPH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SPACE.Display Primary Group Objects
:DATA DEPTH=3.
:DATACOL WIDTH=28.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=UPNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/UPNAME'.User profile
:DATAI VAR=TOTAL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/TOTAL'.Total objects
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=AUTS VIEWS=2 SCROLL=YES.(There are no objects for this primary group.)
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJ USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OBJ'.Object
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJLIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OBJLIB'.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OBJTYPE'.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=ASPDEV USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/ASPDEV'.ASP  Device
:LISTGRP COL=OBJAUTS.&OBJHEAD.
:LISTCOL VAR=OPR USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OPR'.Opr
:LISTCOL VAR=MGT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/MGT'.Mgt
:LISTCOL VAR=EXIST USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EXIST'.Exist
:LISTCOL VAR=ALTER USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/ALTER'.Alter
:LISTCOL VAR=REF USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/REF'.Ref
:ELISTGRP.
:LISTGRP COL=DTAAUTS.&DTAHEAD.
:LISTCOL VAR=READ USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/READ'.Read
:LISTCOL VAR=ADD USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/ADD'.Add
:LISTCOL VAR=UPD USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/UPD'.Update
:LISTCOL VAR=DLT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DLT'.Delete
:LISTCOL VAR=EXE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/EXE'.Execute
:ELISTGRP.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OBJ OBJLIB OBJTYPE ASPDEV OBJAUTS'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OBJ OBJLIB OBJTYPE ASPDEV DTAAUTS'.
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=OBJOWN KEYL=KEYS HELP=OBJOWNH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SPACE.Display Owned Objects
:DATA DEPTH=3.
:DATACOL WIDTH=28.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=UPNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/UPNAME'.User profile
:DATAI VAR=TOTAL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/TOTAL'.Total objects
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=OWNS SCROLL=YES.(The user does not own any objects.)
:LISTCOL VAR=OOBJ USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OOBJ'.Object
:LISTCOL VAR=OOBJLIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OOBJLIB'.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=OOBJTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=11 HELP='FLD/OOBJTYPE'.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=OASPDEV USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=13 HELP='FLD/OASPDEV'.ASP       Device
:LISTCOL VAR=OHOLDER USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=8 HELP='FLD/OHOLDER'.Authority Holder
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=CMDAUT KEYL=KEYS HELP=CMDAUTH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SPACE.Display Authorized Commands
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATACOL WIDTH=24.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=UPNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/UPNAME'.User profile
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=CMDS SCROLL=YES.(User does not have specific authority to any commands.)
:LISTCOL VAR=CMDNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CMDNAME'.
:LISTCOL VAR=CMDLIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CMDLIB'.
:LISTCOL VAR=CMDAUT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CMDAUT'.
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DEVAUT KEYL=KEYS HELP=DEVAUTH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SPACE.Display Authorized Devices
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATACOL WIDTH=24.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=UPNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/UPNAME'.User profile
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=DEVS SCROLL=YES.(User does not have specific authority to any devices.)
:LISTCOL VAR=DEVNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DEVNAME'.
:LISTCOL VAR=DEVAUT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DEVAUT'.
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=GRPMBR KEYL=KEYS HELP=GRPMBRH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SPACE.Display Group Members
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATACOL WIDTH=24.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=UPNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/UPNAME'.User profile
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=MBRS SCROLL=YES.(The group has no members.)
:LISTCOL VAR=MBRNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/MBRNAME'.
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=OBJAUTH.Display Authorized Objects - Help
:P.Every object the user has a private authority to, with the
authorities themselves. F11 switches between the object and the data
authorities.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=OBJPGPH.Display Primary Group Objects - Help
:P.Every object whose primary group is this profile, with the
authorities the group has to it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=OBJOWNH.Display Owned Objects - Help
:P.Every object the user owns, with the library it is in and whether
it is an authority holder.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=CMDAUTH.Display Authorized Commands - Help
:P.The commands the user has a private authority to, each with that
authority.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DEVAUTH.Display Authorized Devices - Help
:P.The device descriptions the user has a private authority to, each
with that authority.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=GRPMBRH.Display Group Members - Help
:P.The user profiles that name this profile as their group or as a
supplemental group.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 leaves the display, F12 goes back one display, F17 and F18 move
to the top and the bottom of the list.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='FLD/UPNAME'.User profile
:P.The user profile shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OBJ'.Object
:P.The object of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OBJLIB'.Library
:P.The library of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OBJTYPE'.Type
:P.The type of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/ASPDEV'.ASP  Device
:P.The ASP Device of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OPR'.&amp.OBJHEAD opr
:P.The &amp.OBJHEAD opr of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/MGT'.&amp.OBJHEAD mgt
:P.The &amp.OBJHEAD mgt of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/EXIST'.&amp.OBJHEAD exist
:P.The &amp.OBJHEAD exist of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/ALTER'.&amp.OBJHEAD alter
:P.The &amp.OBJHEAD alter of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/REF'.&amp.OBJHEAD ref
:P.The &amp.OBJHEAD ref of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/READ'.&amp.DTAHEAD read
:P.The &amp.DTAHEAD read of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/ADD'.&amp.DTAHEAD add
:P.The &amp.DTAHEAD add of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/UPD'.&amp.DTAHEAD update
:P.The &amp.DTAHEAD update of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DLT'.&amp.DTAHEAD delete
:P.The &amp.DTAHEAD delete of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/EXE'.&amp.DTAHEAD execute
:P.The &amp.DTAHEAD execute of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/TOTAL'.Total objects
:P.The total objects shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OOBJ'.Object
:P.The object of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OOBJLIB'.Library
:P.The library of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OOBJTYPE'.Type
:P.The type of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OASPDEV'.ASP       Device
:P.The ASP Device of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OHOLDER'.Authority Holder
:P.The authority Holder of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CMDNAME'.CMDNAME
:P.The CMDNAME of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CMDLIB'.CMDLIB
:P.The CMDLIB of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CMDAUT'.CMDAUT
:P.The CMDAUT of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DEVNAME'.DEVNAME
:P.The DEVNAME of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DEVAUT'.DEVAUT
:P.The DEVAUT of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/MBRNAME'.MBRNAME
:P.The MBRNAME of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
